PRODUCT

ScenarioCraft helps an investor ask a hypothetical market question, see its illustrative effect on a synthetic portfolio, understand the drivers, and request an advisor discussion.

Tagline:
“Ask ‘What if?’ Understand what it means for your portfolio.”

Our selected judging categories:
1. Best Customer Experience.
