DESIGN DIRECTION

Build a credible wealth-management interface with a distinctive, calm visual identity:
- Warm off-white background, dark navy text, restrained teal accents.
- Clear typography, generous spacing, readable numbers.
- Strong visual hierarchy centered on the investor’s question and result.
